    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.poster.avif?t=1740006376\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.webm?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.mp4?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a quest to find hidden capybaras with orange (as well as several cats) across four different scenarios. Visit extraordinary cities both during the day and at night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Capybaras with Orange include</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Searching for hidden capybaras: seek capybaras hidden throughout the city<br></li><li> 4 unique scenarios, including two daytime and two night scenarios<br></li><li> 360 capybaras, 20 cats. Can you find them all?<br></li><li> Relaxing music, perfect for searching for capybaras with oranges!</li></ul><br>Get ready for an exhilarating journey and nighttime escapades in a city full of capybaras!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.poster.avif?t=1740006376\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.webm?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.mp4?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.poster.avif?t=1740006376\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.webm?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/04dbd1882ad24a623105d053080b3be4.mp4?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a quest to find hidden capybaras with orange (as well as several cats) across four different scenarios. Visit extraordinary cities both during the day and at night.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hidden Capybaras with Orange include</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Searching for hidden capybaras: seek capybaras hidden throughout the city<br></li><li> 4 unique scenarios, including two daytime and two night scenarios<br></li><li> 360 capybaras, 20 cats. Can you find them all?<br></li><li> Relaxing music, perfect for searching for capybaras with oranges!</li></ul><br>Get ready for an exhilarating journey and nighttime escapades in a city full of capybaras!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.poster.avif?t=1740006376\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.webm?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714600/extras/46b343e1e2db415bc8dbecc72ecc811e.mp4?t=1740006376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
